1
00:02:30,984 --> 00:02:37,404
Last time, Boss Luffy and company entered a once-in-a-lifetime event,

2
00:02:37,524 --> 00:02:39,304
the Great Portable Shrine Race.

3
00:02:39,824 --> 00:02:41,924
The grand prize is a sacred treasure

4
00:02:41,924 --> 00:02:45,084
passed down through many generations in Grand Japan.

5
00:02:55,084 --> 00:02:55,804
Ah!

6
00:03:00,984 --> 00:03:02,844
While preparing for the big event,

7
00:03:03,044 --> 00:03:06,644
they met Brook, a friendly skeleton who suffered from memory loss.

8
00:03:07,304 --> 00:03:09,104
Spirits were high among all the races

9
00:03:09,104 --> 00:03:11,524
until their portable shrines were destroyed

10
00:03:11,524 --> 00:03:13,624
by Hogback of the Thriller Company,

11
00:03:13,984 --> 00:03:16,584
a group bent on claiming the prize for themselves.

12
00:03:20,664 --> 00:03:21,584
It's over!

13
00:03:21,984 --> 00:03:24,384
There's no way we can enter the big race now!

14
00:03:24,544 --> 00:03:26,644
And it was such a beautiful shrine, too!

15
00:03:28,084 --> 00:03:30,744
If their plan was to wipe out all the portable shrines

16
00:03:30,744 --> 00:03:31,564
before the race,

17
00:03:31,844 --> 00:03:33,904
then that means ours is in danger, too!

18
00:03:37,264 --> 00:03:38,924
I remember what happened.

19
00:03:39,264 --> 00:03:40,624
You got your memory back?

20
00:03:41,224 --> 00:03:41,684
Yes.

21
00:03:42,444 --> 00:03:45,624
I remember everything now.

22
00:03:49,324 --> 00:03:51,464
Hey, what's with the hat and that get-up?

23
00:03:51,864 --> 00:03:53,044
Because it looks like you're leaving.

24
00:03:53,344 --> 00:03:54,824
I shouldn't be here with you,

25
00:03:54,924 --> 00:03:55,884
from what I remember.

26
00:03:56,444 --> 00:03:58,104
And I'm ashamed to say this.

27
00:03:58,104 --> 00:04:01,504
I believe that I'm actually a member

28
00:04:01,504 --> 00:04:02,604
of the Thriller Company.

29
00:04:03,224 --> 00:04:05,904
And so, with his memory suddenly returned,

30
00:04:06,244 --> 00:04:09,524
Brook disappeared into the dark of night all alone.

31
00:04:09,524 --> 00:04:19,224
Feudal-era side story.

32
00:04:19,564 --> 00:04:21,284
Defeat Thriller Company's trap.

33
00:04:30,484 --> 00:04:33,064
That was a pretty good rampage tonight, guys.

34
00:04:33,244 --> 00:04:33,784
Agreed.

35
00:04:33,844 --> 00:04:36,184
And I think Peronis almost should be quite pleased.

36
00:04:36,184 --> 00:04:41,784
Who are you?

37
00:04:45,004 --> 00:04:48,104
Every one of you has strayed from the path of humanity.

38
00:04:49,104 --> 00:04:51,204
Not that you were human, to begin with.

39
00:04:51,724 --> 00:04:53,624
And now, in the name of heaven,

40
00:04:54,084 --> 00:04:55,904
I shall punish you!

41
00:04:55,904 --> 00:05:13,304
There.

42
00:05:13,304 --> 00:05:14,684
That should do it.

43
00:05:15,084 --> 00:05:15,764
Thanks, buddy.

44
00:05:16,384 --> 00:05:18,964
I couldn't stop him from destroying the portable shrine.

45
00:05:19,404 --> 00:05:20,764
The race is tomorrow, too.

46
00:05:21,164 --> 00:05:22,624
I'm a failure as a carpenter.

47
00:05:22,624 --> 00:05:24,144
You gave it your best.

48
00:05:24,224 --> 00:05:25,444
You didn't do a thing wrong.

49
00:05:26,044 --> 00:05:27,944
Hogback and his Thriller Company cronies

50
00:05:27,944 --> 00:05:28,924
are to blame for this.

51
00:05:30,384 --> 00:05:30,664
Hmm.

52
00:05:31,584 --> 00:05:33,084
And then there's Brook.

53
00:05:37,904 --> 00:05:38,964
Yeah, I'm worried.

54
00:05:39,384 --> 00:05:40,724
Any idea where he went?

55
00:05:43,324 --> 00:05:44,904
Would you like me to tell you?

56
00:05:45,004 --> 00:05:45,344
Hmm?

57
00:05:46,004 --> 00:05:46,244
Hmm?

58
00:05:47,904 --> 00:05:48,844
Who are you?

59
00:05:48,844 --> 00:05:52,564
Just a city girl who happened to be passing by.

60
00:05:53,684 --> 00:05:54,824
She's beautiful!

61
00:05:55,204 --> 00:05:56,564
You would think so, huh?

62
00:05:58,744 --> 00:06:02,124
Though the skeleton was indeed once a member of the Thriller Company,

63
00:06:02,604 --> 00:06:04,424
