00:14:08,924 --> 00:14:10,084
They've taken the lead!

282
00:14:18,164 --> 00:14:20,744
Hey! My flying fish!

283
00:14:21,964 --> 00:14:23,684
Keep curling it!

284
00:14:23,684 --> 00:14:24,944
Me!

285
00:14:28,844 --> 00:14:32,264
Fast, fast, fast, fast, fast, fast, fast, fast, fast!

286
00:14:38,264 --> 00:14:40,984
Sorry, this thing is really heavy, master!

287
00:14:40,984 --> 00:14:42,844
You feeble imbeciles!

288
00:14:42,844 --> 00:14:44,444
They're gonna catch up to us!

289
00:14:44,444 --> 00:14:46,264
Stay calm, everyone!

290
00:14:46,264 --> 00:14:48,564
This is the genius hog-backed shrine!

291
00:14:48,564 --> 00:14:50,644
It's got a trick or two up its sleeve!

292
00:14:50,644 --> 00:14:51,644
Eh.

293
00:14:53,684 --> 00:14:57,944
Oh, fast, fast, fast, fast, fast, fast!

294
00:14:58,344 --> 00:14:58,744
What?

295
00:15:14,324 --> 00:15:16,224
Stand out, suckas!

296
00:15:17,224 --> 00:15:19,464
What the? How's he doing that?

297
00:15:19,524 --> 00:15:21,384
Don't sweat it, bro. I wouldn't be the master

298
00:15:21,384 --> 00:15:23,584
if I didn't hook this shrine up with some tricks of its own.

299
00:15:23,584 --> 00:15:23,784
Huh?

300
00:15:26,204 --> 00:15:29,544
Hey, boss, pour this coal in the shrine's mouth, okay?

301
00:15:30,324 --> 00:15:30,804
Catch!

302
00:15:32,064 --> 00:15:32,544
Right.

303
00:15:33,604 --> 00:15:34,524
Open wide.

304
00:15:34,524 --> 00:15:48,004
Everyone, hop on board the shrine!

305
00:15:52,004 --> 00:15:53,704
Here we go!

306
00:15:54,704 --> 00:15:55,584
Oh, no!

307
00:15:55,584 --> 00:16:04,604
Hey, that's against the rule!

308
00:16:04,764 --> 00:16:06,304
Yeah, like you're one to talk!

309
00:16:06,664 --> 00:16:08,884
Are these really portable shrines anymore?

310
00:16:17,324 --> 00:16:20,144
Someone stop this infernal jostling!

311
00:16:20,404 --> 00:16:21,884
Don't worry, I'll handle it!

312
00:16:25,584 --> 00:16:28,544
Try this on for size!

313
00:16:28,544 --> 00:16:30,144
Uh, that's a cannon!

314
00:16:34,184 --> 00:16:35,904
So, it's like that, huh?

315
00:16:41,504 --> 00:16:43,744
Boss, there you have it!

316
00:16:43,824 --> 00:16:45,524
Victory is finally ours!

317
00:16:45,624 --> 00:16:46,224
Oh, no!

318
00:16:48,144 --> 00:16:48,764
Look!

319
00:16:55,584 --> 00:17:06,544
Take us to the finish, support panel!

320
00:17:12,424 --> 00:17:14,384
Hardcore, too much press!

321
00:17:14,764 --> 00:17:16,664
I think I like you better that way!

322
00:17:17,524 --> 00:17:18,344
Hey, guys!

323
00:17:18,804 --> 00:17:20,384
Just keep moving along the river!

324
00:17:20,644 --> 00:17:22,304
It's a quicker route than going on land!

325
00:17:22,424 --> 00:17:23,284
Right! Got it!

326
00:17:23,284 --> 00:17:32,424
Now they're mine!

327
00:17:32,564 --> 00:17:33,544
After them, attack!

328
00:17:44,624 --> 00:17:45,104
Crap!

329
00:17:45,344 --> 00:17:46,944
There's just no end to these jerks!

330
00:17:47,004 --> 00:17:48,784
I was counting on something like this!

331
00:17:48,924 --> 00:17:50,604
If you've got a way to help us, do it!

332
00:17:50,664 --> 00:17:51,124
Uh-huh!

333
00:17:51,124 --> 00:18:03,204
Keep this thing steady for me, all right?

334
00:18:03,304 --> 00:18:05,144
Careful, you'll bite your tongue off!

335
00:18:05,344 --> 00:18:06,024
Shut up!

336
00:18:07,384 --> 00:18:09,124
36 caliber Phoenix!

337
00:18:09,124 --> 00:18:16,984
Look up there!

338
00:18:17,164 --> 00:18:18,564
It's the Grand Shrine!

339
00:18:19,504 --> 00:18:21,464
Boss, this is the last of the cola!

340
00:18:21,904 --> 00:18:22,804
Right! Got it!

341
00:18:22,804 --> 00:18:46,364
I'll show them!

342
00:18:46,364 --> 00:18:47,204
Activate!

343
00:18:47,204 --> 00:18:48,684
Look!

344
00:18:48,684 --> 00:19:04,044
The finish line!

345
00:19:05,724 --> 00:19:06,304
Yeah!

346
00:19:06,304 --> 00:19:08,324
Go!

347
00:19:08,324 --> 00:19:09,164
Whoa!

348
00:19:19,344 --> 00:19:20,504
You've gotta be kidding.

349
00:19:20,504 --> 00:19:23,164
Is that the portable shrine's final form?

350
00:19:24,604 --> 00:19:25,944
Foosh!

351
00:19:25,944 --> 00:19:28,884
Munchie! Munchie!

352
00:19:28,884 --> 00:19:30,884
That's one hell of a spider.

353
00:19:30,884 --> 00:19:34,124
I commend you for forcing me to use my tramp card.

354
00:19:34,124 --> 00:19:36,844
However, this is the end!

355
00:19:36,844 --> 00:19:38,684
Spider-Sticky Nuts!

356
00:19:45,324 --> 00:19:47,464
Damn, we're super stuck.

357
00:19:47,464 --> 00:19:49,124
Come on, can't you do something?

358
00:19:49,124 --> 00:19:50,564
Get us out of this.

359
00:19:50,564 --> 00:19:54,364
Well, I do have one last trick up my sleeve.

360
00:19:54,364 --> 00:19:55,664
I'm all out of cola.

361
00:19:59,004 --> 00:20:00,164
Wait, cola?

362
00:20:01,604 --> 00:20:03,364
Onami-san, down there.

363
00:20:06,844 --> 00:20:10,084
This is as far as you go.

364
00:20:10,604 --> 00:20:12,084
Da-da-da-da-da-da-da-da.

365
00:20:12,084 --> 00:20:14,384
Whoa! Munchie, munchie, munchie, munchie!

366
00:20:14,384 --> 00:20:15,484
Aaah!

367
00:20:19,364 --> 00:20:21,164
Boss Luffy!

368
00:20:21,164 --> 00:20:23,524
Catch!

369
00:20:23,524 --> 00:20:30,524
Don't turn it!

370
00:20:30,524 --> 00:20:31,524
Fire!

371
00:20:35,524 --> 00:20:36,524
Whee!

372
00:20:36,524 --> 00:20:38,524
This can't be!

373
00:20:38,524 --> 00:20:40,524
Hang on to something!

374
00:20:40,524 --> 00:20:43,524
Where in the hell did Sidri go at a time like this?

375
00:20:45,524 --> 00:20:48,524
See a burning dose!

376
00:20:53,524 --> 00:20:57,524
Let's discuss this!

377
00:20:57,524 --> 00:21:01,524
Everyone was looking forward to this festival and this race and you ruined it!

378
00:21:01,524 --> 00:21:03,524
So now you're gonna pay!

379
00:21:03,524 --> 00:21:05,524
But I don't wanna!

380
00:21:11,524 --> 00:21:15,524
And that makes the winner Pinwheel Eatery!

381
00:21:19,524 --> 00:21:22,524
Congratulations. Now about the prize.

382
00:21:22,524 --> 00:21:25,524
I know, it's one million Rio Berries!

383
00:21:25,524 --> 00:21:28,524
Sorry, but I'm going to have to keep this.

384
00:21:28,524 --> 00:21:29,524
Huh?

385
00:21:29,524 --> 00:21:32,524
Your racing left this town in a state of disaster.

386
00:21:32,524 --> 00:21:34,524
No fair!

387
00:21:34,524 --> 00:21:36,524
Never fear.

388
00:21:36,524 --> 00:21:37,524
Huh?

389
00:21:37,524 --> 00:21:40,524
Just as was promised, the sacred treasure in the temple is yours.

390
00:21:40,524 --> 00:21:42,524
All right!

391
00:21:42,524 --> 00:21:43,524
Way to go, guys.

392
00:21:43,524 --> 00:21:46,524
I wonder what the sacred treasure is like.

393
00:21:46,524 --> 00:21:49,524
It's been 100 years since the shrine was last opened,

394
00:21:49,524 --> 00:21:52,524
so this will be my first time seeing it as well.

395
00:21:55,524 --> 00:21:58,524
This is the magical sacred treasure

396
00:21:58,524 --> 00:22:00,524
passed down in Grand Japan

397
00:22:00,524 --> 00:22:02,524
generation after generation

398
00:22:02,524 --> 00:22:04,524
for this day!

399
00:22:04,524 --> 00:22:05,524
Huh?

400
00:22:05,524 --> 00:22:19,524
Instructions for the maiden panties.

401
00:22:19,524 --> 00:22:24,524
Make a wish with these panties on and that wish will be granted forthwith.

402
00:22:24,524 --> 00:22:26,524
Again, you must be wearing them.

403
00:22:26,524 --> 00:22:30,524
Wait, limited to beautiful women only?

404
00:22:30,524 --> 00:22:32,524
They're just perfect!

405
00:22:32,524 --> 00:22:33,524
Oh, Mao-san.

406
00:22:33,524 --> 00:22:36,524
Would you mind putting on those wish-making panties for me?

407
00:22:36,524 --> 00:22:41,524
Wait, who am I?

408
00:22:41,524 --> 00:22:44,524
What's going on here?

409
00:22:44,524 --> 00:22:47,524
It looks like Brooks lost his memory again!

410
00:22:47,524 --> 00:22:49,524
Brooks-san, I'm so sorry!

411
00:22:49,524 --> 00:22:50,524
I'm sorry!

412
00:23:06,524 --> 00:23:09,524
Well, far from Zappa Odi by Kuma's strange power,

413
00:23:09,524 --> 00:23:11,524
Luffy finds himself on an unfamiliar island.

414
00:23:11,524 --> 00:23:14,524
After an unfortunate bunny with some poisonous mushrooms,

415
00:23:14,524 --> 00:23:16,524
he falls unconscious.

416
00:23:16,524 --> 00:23:19,524
Gravely ill, he is approached by a team of female warriors

417
00:23:19,524 --> 00:23:21,524
who could be friend or foe.

418
00:23:21,524 --> 00:23:23,524
On the next One Piece,

419
00:23:23,524 --> 00:23:26,524
landing the all-female island Amazon Lily!

420
00:23:26,524 --> 00:23:29,524
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

